						</box>
						<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
							<font fontName="Serif" size="9" isBold="false" isItalic="false"/>
						</textElement>
						<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["The above said repaired vehicle was re-inspected by the undersigned for the reference of " +
(($F{insurer} == null) ? "" : $F{insurer}) + " " +
(($F{deputing_address} == null) ? "" : $F{deputing_address}) + 
". Re-inspected the vehicle at " + 
(($F{workshop} == null) ? "" : $F{workshop}) + " on " +
(($F{deputation_date} == null) ? "" : $F{deputation_date}) +
" and found the vehicle repaired. Replacements & the repairing work examined & inspected carefully by us and matched as allowed in the final survey report. During inspection it was observed that all the new parts as allowed in final settlement were found replaced with associated labour work done satisfactorily.\n\n" +

"Serial numbers Assemblies for vehicle identification noted as Chassis No. : " +
(($F{chassis_no} == null) ? "" : $F{chassis_no}) + " & Engine No. : " +
(($F{motor_no} == null) ? "" : $F{motor_no}) + ". Salvage was verified and was found in order.\n" +

"                  1. Major Replacement : Checked & Found in order.\n" +
"                  2. Major Repairs     : Checked & Found in order.\n\n" +

"Salvage verified & found in order. The same was instructed to be destroyed & provide the scrap value. Photographs of repaired vehicle along with salvage are enclosed herewith."]]></textFieldExpression>
					</textField>
				</frame>
			</frame>
